00:33:49.680 --> 00:34:13.979
They become then very cruel also. So fascism and also communism and all these isms, all these ideologies, they are kind of within ourselves. They're kind of archetypes that then express themselves and they can be brought forth through certain situations, certain rituals, certain imagery that comes up. There's also always associated with that.

00:34:14.460 --> 00:34:29.041
And suddenly you have these psychic epidemics that people are caught by something And they're rioting in the street and they're, they're killing and they're looting and they're doing horrible things. They overstep the bounds of humanity. And Jung says this is archetypal.

